"""Evidence library for the Sunnytime Check result card (2026-10-25).

Every sentence a parent reads is one fact with its source. Facts were gathered by four research
passes and each quote re-checked against its live page by an independent checker
(scratchpad evidence/verify_*.json). Wording keeps the strength of the source: a law is a law, a
proposal a proposal, a recommendation a recommendation, an expert's article an expert's article.
"other_side" holds the official findings that point the other way; "not_known" says what no
source establishes. No sentence draws a conclusion for the parent.

Run: python3 data/reference/evidence_library_src.py  ->  data/reference/evidence_library.json
"""
